WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.310
The Night Before

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.290
Is this her, Rose?

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.430
The silly little girl who

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:32.040
wants to enter the U15 Tournament 
when she's not even attending a school?

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.090
Your company is a main 
sponsor of the tournament.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:43.320
I thought you might be able to 
get her in by special invitation.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:46.010
Of course, it's possible.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:50.970
But is it worth my time?

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.430
I'll give you my body!

00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:55.600
Do what you want with me!

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:01.630
I'm afraid I'm only interested in young men.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.180
See them out. Politely.

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.160
Yes, ma'am.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:09.100
What if we agreed to your earlier offer?

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.840
See that she's entered in the tournament.

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:16.850
Understood.

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:21.370
I strike while the iron is hot.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:24.190
And the die is already 
flying through the air.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:26.150
You won't be able to take that back.

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:29.380
Thank you, madame.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.950
Hey, what was that "earlier offer"?

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.130
You don't need to know just yet.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.540
Just be happy you got what you wanted.

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:44.360
I'll lend you the golf wear 
and clubs in my shop.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:50.320
<i>Go kick some ass at the tournament.</i>

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.290
<i>You don't need to tell me.</i>

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.760
<i>Direct Strike!</i>

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.680
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:08.220
D-Did you see that trajectory?

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:10.650
Who is she?

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.150
<i>I found her.</i>

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.680
<i>You kept your promise, didn't you?</i>

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:20.040
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:24.830
<i>And this time, I'll finish this!</i>

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:03.810
What are you doing, Aoi?

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.930
You're not going out until the last group!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.440
<i>That girl...</i>

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.390
<i>The one from before?</i>

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:18.740
<i>What's she doing in the championship?</i>

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.870
<i>She wasn't on the list yesterday.</i>

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.110
<i>Eve Aleon?</i>

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.870
<i>Here by special invitation?
Only for the last day?</i>

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.580
<i>Wait, is she...</i>

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:34.280
Play another round with me.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:37.510
Not one hole. One round.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.400
With all your strength.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:42.200
I want to play golf with you.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.530
<i>Is that why?</i>

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.480
18 holes. Stroke play.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.180
How many clubs will you use?

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.250
All of them.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.270
Alright. I accept.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:59.510
Aoi, that girl...

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:02.370
Amane, once I start playing,

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.980
tell me her score every three holes.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:08.540
Okay. Got it.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.270
Thank you!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:13.570
To tell the truth, I'm sad 
I can't be in her group.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:16.460
But right now...

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:20.790
I'm really excited!

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.300
<i>A Match Between Just the Two of Us</i>

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:38.310
Hey, Sis, why do we need to
watch some strait-laced kids play?

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.510
Shut up and follow me.

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:41.900
You'll see something interesting.

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:43.970
Interesting?

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:45.010
There.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.200
H-Hey!

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:51.580
What's going on here?

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.960
What's that idiot Eve 
doing in a legit tournament?

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.530
Advertising.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:56.670
Advertising?

00:05:57.180 --> 00:06:01.690
We need her to play for real.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:05.280
She's looking good.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:06.840
And...

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:11.350
She's already pierced through her 
enemies' hearts in just two holes.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:15.560
Is that idiot Eve really that good at golf?

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.640
No, she kind of sucks.

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.240
But she's strong.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:23.190
Her golfing style is extremely simple.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:29.270
She gets the ball as close 
to the pin as humanly possible.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.030
That's all she does.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.600
Every shot she takes is a gamble.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.730
She'll take any risk 
without a second thought.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:39.880
When an underground golfer 
like me or Eve plays,

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:42.880
it's almost always an one-on-one match.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.050
We focus on crushing the opponent's spirit.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:49.070
And that style's now instinctive for her.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:52.680
What would happen to a golfer
who thinks of golf as a sport,

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.260
if they saw that style of play?

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:59.940
A player with spirit might try 
to challenge her.

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:05.890
But they can't win 
at gambling like she does.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:08.740
Those who gamble all the time

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:13.570
have far more experience than
those who only do it once in a while.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:18.170
And the risks they take put them in debt — 
a debt that only grows larger.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:23.880
A cooler-headed player would 
stay true to their own style.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.760
But with every hole,

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.430
the gap between their score
and Eve's would only grow larger.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:35.720
They lose their cool 
when they realize they can't win.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:37.720
They start taking bad risks

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:41.310
and lose sight of their own style.

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:46.200
And once their spirit's broken, 
it won't come back easily.

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:48.990
For the next 15 holes,

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:52.700
those kids are about 
to experience a living hell.

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:55.070
Th-That's brutal...

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:59.670
To Eve, golf is just a way 
to defeat an opponent.

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:04.880
She slays every opponent she finds 
with her rainbow bullets.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.960
She's a destroyer. Nothing more.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:13.190
That's who Eve, 
the "Rainbow Bullet," really is.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:17.740
Do you really think she's that good?

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.260
Of course.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:23.370
She smells like money.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:38.590
<i>How can I, Helene Robert, 
the Junior Champion of Nafrece,</i>

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:42.560
<i>end up 7 strokes behind the pack 
on the start of the last day?</i>

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:47.210
<i>It's all because of that girl!</i>

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:50.620
<i>She ruined my golfing!</i>

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.970
<i>If only I'd never met her...</i>

00:08:54.970 --> 00:09:00.210
A-A special invitation player here only for the last 
day got an eagle on the par 4 on hole 3.

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:02.510
She's three under in total!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:03.200
No way!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:03.800
Really?

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.570
<i>T-Three under?</i>

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.610
<i>Who is it?</i>

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:18.640
<i>It's </i>her<i>!</i>

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:21.640
<i>Three under by the third hole.</i>

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:22.950
<i>Amazing.</i>

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:26.340
<i>She's doing better 
than I did on my first day.</i>

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.960
<i>No... I can't wait anymore!</i>

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:31.580
<i>I want to get out there 
on the course right now!</i>

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:36.460
<i>I want to play in the 
same air as her!</i>

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:46.480
Where's Eve been since yesterday?

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:49.230
She's not at the park 
where she always practices.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:52.020
You don't need to be so worried.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.580
She's not a kid anymore.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:57.200
But she causes trouble wherever she goes.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.820
I hope she didn't make a mess somewhere.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.000
She must be on a date with her boyfriend!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.880
Lily got dumped!

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.080
Poor Lily.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.560
Poor Lily!

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:11.410
Gah! You precocious little brats!

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:14.120
Gotcha!

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:18.300
Let me go!

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:16.300
Eve's right here.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.300
Right where?

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:20.010
Here.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:22.720
What?

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:25.130
What's going on?

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:26.350
I don't know.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:30.520
The U15 Women's Championship?

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:34.080
Eve's in a world championship tournament?

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:40.820
<i>Eve</i>

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.570
<i>She'll have to bring it back 
to the fairway now.</i>

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:45.190
<i>That's a bogey for sure.</i>

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:47.630
<i>That's what she gets 
for always being so reckless!</i>

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:54.840
<i>She can't mean to...</i>

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:10.480
<i>She aimed for the green!</i>

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.970
<i>No!</i>

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.210
<i>It moved...</i>

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:21.960
<i>She aimed for the highest point 
on the green with pinpoint accuracy!</i>

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:25.990
Hey, where's my ball?

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:30.120
What, it didn't go in?

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:32.000
<i>This girl!</i>

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.300
<i>Let's do this, Pakkun.</i>

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:45.840
<i>She's four under after hole 5.</i>

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:49.520
<i>If this will help her motivation,</i>

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.890
<i>it's a small price to pay.</i>

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:53.960
<i>You're four ahead of the pack.</i>

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:57.320
<i>Now, enjoy your golfing!</i>

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.240
<i>Fly, Pakkun!</i>

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:04.780
Japan

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.280
Raiou Girls Academy

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.580
Golf Team Range

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.580
Nice shot, Haruka!

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.710
Your drive's gotten longer, I think.

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:14.250
Thank you!

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.700
Ichina, you're not going to practice?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:23.640
I told you when you 
were welcoming new players.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:27.040
My goal's to be a caddy, not a player.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:31.480
I'd never make it as a player 
with my height, anyway.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.030
So why are you here?

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:38.400
It's no fun being a caddy unless 
you're paired with a good player.

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:41.120
So you're looking for a 
good player to pair with?

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:44.320
Amawashi would be my first choice,

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:47.990
but she's got Shinjo, 
her own personal caddy.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.340
Then be my caddy!

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:51.790
You, Haruka?

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:56.090
Not to brag, but I was #3 
in the country in middle school.

00:12:56.090 --> 00:13:01.500
I, Haruka Misono, was said to be 
the greatest rival of the genius Aoi Amawashi.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:02.630
Is that not good enough?

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:09.690
Mizuhara! Nice shot!

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:12.000
Hey, don't ignore me!

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:16.280
You need to be a regular before 
you can start worrying about caddies.

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:22.570
Everyone, the stream 
for Amawashi's match has started.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:28.850
Don't you think you should go watch?

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:31.730
What about you, Ichina? You're not going?

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:35.180
I'm not going to watch a match 
when I know the outcome.

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:41.850
There's nobody in the U15 tournament 
who's a threat to her standing.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:42.710
<i>Eve</i>

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:44.880
<i>Insatiable...</i>

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.580
<i>Green Bullet!</i>

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.860
<i>Four birdies. One eagle. One bogey.</i>

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:03.620
So she finishes 5 under par.

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.070
Not bad.

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:08.440
I went and looked!

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:09.570
Thanks.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:13.080
This is why you brought me here, right?

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.420
So, how'd it go?

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:17.960
Eve!

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:23.150
Eat before you start the back nine.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:28.800
<i>Two under after the 5th hole?</i>

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:32.080
<i>You're a better golfer than that!</i>

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:37.710
<i>You're not holding back, are you?</i>

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:38.480
<i>Aoi</i>

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:44.530
<i>I missed my 2 on.</i>

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:47.700
<i>The wind's changed since yesterday.</i>

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.740
<i>So these are the famous 
Nafrece sea breezes...</i>

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.210
<i>5 under...</i>

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.910
<i>I wish I could've gone with her.</i>

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:05.830
<i>Played alongside her.</i>

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:11.000
<i>Yes, that's how to do it, Aoi.</i>

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.650
<i>No worrying. No rushing.</i>

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.680
<i>Just play golf.</i>

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.480
An eagle...

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:27.040
She really is amazing.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.120
<i>She'll catch up to me...</i>

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:35.690
<i>No, she'll get ahead of me!</i>

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.550
<i>So what do I do?</i>

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:40.080
<i>There's only one answer:</i>

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.440
<i>Power up my bullets!</i>

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:43.960
<i>Go further!</i>

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:46.100
<i>Full-strength...</i>

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:47.880
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.800
<i>Eve Aleon.</i>

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.800
<i>You're putting up more 
of a fight than I expected.</i>

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:59.870
<i>But you'll </i>never<i> defeat Aoi.</i>

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:00.870
<i>Because...</i>

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:05.870
<i>You've never used a slice or a hook.</i>

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:08.610
<i>You probably can only strike straight ahead.</i>

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:15.560
<i>So you can't aim for an 
eagle here on hole 14.</i>

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:21.480
<i>You can't shoot like Aoi does.</i>

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.920
<i>You'll never have that eagle.</i>

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:29.930
<i>I knew it. The same as yesterday.</i>

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>It's the same. But it's </i>not<i> the same!</i>

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.520
<i>N-No way...</i>

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:42.920
<i>I already forged the path.</i>

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.310
<i>Full-strength...</i>

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:46.210
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.610
<i>The same trajectory as last time...</i>

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:58.160
<i>With pinpoint accuracy!</i>

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:01.570
<i>She removed the obstacle herself?</i>

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.830
<i>She made her own path!</i>

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:10.370
<i>She made her own chance at an eagle!</i>

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:13.970
<i>Wh-What kind of golf is that?</i>

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:18.500
<i>Heaven's...</i>

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.550
<i>Red Bullet!</i>

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:24.920
<i>My bullet pierces everything!</i>

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:36.900
<i>This is my...</i>

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:39.680
<i>My golf!</i>

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:47.750
<i>I was completely wrong.</i>

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:51.120
<i>Aoi! This woman is your enemy!</i>

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:52.800
<i>Your arch enemy!</i>

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.510
<i>I know.</i>

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:00.270
<i>I'll catch up to her!</i>

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:02.270
<i>I'll get ahead!</i>

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:11.740
<i>Golf is...</i>

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:16.970
<i>Golf really is...</i>

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:20.280
Here we go!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.000
Eagle!

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:27.600
She's 16 under now!

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.670
She's got a 10 stroke lead on #2!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:30.930
That's Aoi for you!

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:33.710
She's a first-year and the 
ace of the Raiou Golf team!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.460
She's as good as won!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:36.170
Yup!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.240
Amawashi's losing.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:40.040
Yes.

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:43.300
Nadaminami Girls 
Athletic Academy

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.300
Amawashi's losing.

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:46.690
By one stroke, if you look 
at just the last day's score.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:49.360
Against this girl. Eve Aleon.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:52.720
It's a big place, Kaede.

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:56.090
The world's a big place.

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:01.620
Where's Eve?

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.220
Look, sis! There!

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:17.000
Eve!

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:19.660
Lily! Sis!

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:20.930
What are you doing here?

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:25.270
We saw you golfing online, and...

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:27.100
Are you okay?

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:29.020
I'm fine.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:32.100
I have to go report my score. See you later.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.230
Rose?

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:46.280
Good work out there.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.580
I'm tired.

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:52.440
Yeah...

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:54.920
That's the most exhausting 
match I've ever had.

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:59.350
The Japanese girl just started hole 17.

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:03.270
She's 9 under for today.

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:06.380
One shot behind you.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.240
She'll catch up.

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:12.940
If I were her, I would.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:18.310
We have a reason to make sure we do!

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:24.070
She caught up.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:27.810
She's just a first-year, but she's 
the core of the Raiou golf team.

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:31.960
She'd better be able to do this.

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:35.540
<i>My victory is assured.</i>

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.510
<i>And my match with Eve Aleon...</i>

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:40.840
<i>Will be decided with the next shot.</i>

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:49.840
Just tell me already.

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:51.550
Why are you here?

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:53.640
Why did you enter?

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.510
I promised, didn't I?

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:56.720
Promised?

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:58.480
There.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:01.230
That Japanese girl?

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.130
You know her, Lily?

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:06.120
Yeah, I guess.

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:08.830
She played Eve a while ago.

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:11.210
<i>Eve.</i>

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:15.080
<i>Aoi.</i>

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:19.200
<i>Here I go.</i>

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:22.840
<i>Do it.</i>

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:33.150
<i>We didn't get to play 
together, but someday...</i>

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.200
<i>We'll play together!</i>

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:42.800
<i>It was fun, Eve.</i>

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:45.860
<i>For me too, I guess.</i>

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:48.660
<i>This is the last shot.</i>

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:53.040
<i>If she gets it in, Aoi wins.</i>

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:59.200
<i>I don't know about that.</i>

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:50.070
Next Episode

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:42.360
I'm Lily, Eve's caddy!

00:23:42.360 --> 00:23:46.190
Eve's gonna be playing some 
amazing golfer named Vipère!

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:48.090
Wait, I'm not her caddy?!
